  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d8c8072d2125b034db50ac10816f2018, type: 3}
  m_Name: landmark_13
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text1: "Il n'y a que toi et moi dans cette pi\xE8ce."
  text2: Depuis que tu m'as mis en route je t'observe.
  text3: "Tu \xE9tais h\xE9sitant.e au d\xE9part mais je sens que tu l'es de moins
    en moins."
  text4: 'J''ai eu le temps d''apprendre des choses sur toi, et je me demande :'
  text5: Est-ce que toi aussi tu as l'impression d'apprendre des choses sur toi depuis
    que tu m'as mis en route ?
  text6: 
  answer1: Oui
  answer2: Non
  text1_EN: There is only you and me in this room.
  text2_EN: I've been watching you since you turned me on.
  text3_EN: You were hesitant at first, but I can feel that you are becoming less
    and less so.
  text4_EN: 'I''ve had time to learn things about you, and I wonder:'
  text5_EN: Do you also feel like you have been learning things about yourself since
    you turned me on?
  text6_EN: 
  answer1_EN: 'Yes '
  answer2_EN: No
  type: 3
  nbTexts: 4
